{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for object, approach and take it. If not found, approach another object. Finally, process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLocated    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
